{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the team's operator, build and maintain your team to fight against hostiles escalating in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.poster.avif?t=1763526192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.webm?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.mp4?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a random selection of characters, abilities, mods, and upgrade chips.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters have unique stats and classes, Attackers, Defenders, and Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team abilities, triggered automatically by characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operator abilities, triggered manually by selecting characters or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods, increases stats by rarity and triggers elemental effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chips, increases stats and can stack continually.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.poster.avif?t=1763526192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.webm?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.mp4?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss on round 20 to complete the run and raise the heat level cap.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat level increases the difficulty and can increase infinitely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the run is a success or failure, earn experience to upgrade your team or unlock special traits to enhance your future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a checklist of goals during the run to earn additional experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118030?t=1763526192","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118030?t=1763526192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/b2444bbf445727bc8954b046d552433caef4338a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763526192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/b2444bbf445727bc8954b046d552433caef4338a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763526192","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the team's operator, build and maintain your team to fight against hostiles escalating in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.poster.avif?t=1763526192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.webm?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.mp4?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a random selection of characters, abilities, mods, and upgrade chips.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters have unique stats and classes, Attackers, Defenders, and Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team abilities, triggered automatically by characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operator abilities, triggered manually by selecting characters or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods, increases stats by rarity and triggers elemental effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chips, increases stats and can stack continually.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.poster.avif?t=1763526192\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.webm?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/91cd39a101fbeaad9de8d9589a933358.mp4?t=1763526192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss on round 20 to complete the run and raise the heat level cap.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat level increases the difficulty and can increase infinitely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the run is a success or failure, earn experience to upgrade your team or unlock special traits to enhance your future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a checklist of goals during the run to earn additional experience.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Derek Tanis"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/58403464faa8d93a284f391e4e3f7bcbc52fbf93/header.jpg?t=1763526192","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118030/333024956/fbc9bf1a04569fa48c2e2abf3dc4a6655c34d13c/1760672158/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761275432","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118030/333024956/fbc9bf1a04569fa48c2e2abf3dc4a6655c34d13c/1760672158/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761275432","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4118030/333024956/fbc9bf1a04569fa48c2e2abf3dc4a6655c34d13c/1760672158/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761275432","id":257219052,"name":"Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219052/a0d496980941493d42cf39987c1953e6a115b544/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761275432"}],"name":"Planetary Field Team","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 or newer<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommen